  "body": "This has been discussed before - so please add links to relevant threads.\r\nMy main use-case is service worker post-messaging to client tabs that are frozen or discarded (by browser or OS). \r\nWe expect this to be lot more frequent with upcoming interventions related to Lifecycle: https://github.com/WICG/web-lifecycle\r\n\r\nThis was also previously discussed here:  https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/issues/677\r\n\r\n@domenic @jakearchibald @fmeawad",
